# B05-UI integration patch (apply from the integrator branch)
#
# This patch touches public wiring files owned by the integrator. The feature
# modules, tests and docs are already committed on cc/B05-identity-ui. It is
# not a replacement for reviewing exact line numbers after parallel merges.
#
# Wiring summary:
#  1. desktop/app.go: render identity dialogs from App.View; run
#     prepareConfirmedSend() before building a plan; attach the exact-scope
#     one-shot confirm gate after network options are built.
#  2. desktop/workspace.go: add four Identity Management project-menu entries.
#  3. desktop/tree_actions.go: add a per-folder "Folder auth" context menu.
#  4. core/plan.go: consume PlanConfirmGate(plan) for Hop 0 ONLY and
#     re-evaluate each redirect hop with Confirmed=false. No public
#     ExecuteOptions field is needed: the gate is attached to the exact Plan
#     through core.SetPlanConfirmGate.
#
# Do NOT set tabNetStateFor(tab).policyConfirmed = true anywhere: that broad
# flag would let a redirect reuse a confirmation. core.Execute consumes the
# gate once, for the initial target only.
#
# go.mod / go.sum: unchanged. No public core model/storage-format changes.
# When no gate is attached, existing transport behavior is unchanged.
#
